1nk7|a|Alive; living; animate; -- opposed to dead or inanimate. ; Characterized by life or liveliness; animated; sprightly; agile; brisk; ready. ; Speedy; hasty; swift; not slow; as, be quick. ; Impatient; passionate; hasty; eager; eager; sharp; unceremonious; as, a quick temper. ; Fresh; bracing; sharp; keen. ; Sensitive; perceptive in a high degree; ready; as, a quick ear. ; Pregnant; with child.	j:uwc,76,2;1t0n,61,7;rz2,52,5;pxn,40,4;c16,35,4;21hb,34,4;1czb,33,2;16so,32,4;3d4,25,5;2881,21,3~1t0n,61,7;rz2,52,5;3d4,25,5;pxn,40,4;16so,32,4;21hb,34,4;c16,35,4;1njd,17,4;2881,21,3;1czb,33,2	e:1lgp,25,3;2753,21,8;22p7,19,6~2753,21,8;22p7,19,6;1lgp,25,3
